The set of pairwise maxima of elements from `A` and `B`.

Logical form:

```lean
def PairwiseMax (A B : Set ℝ) : Set ℝ :=
  {x | ∃ a ∈ A, ∃ b ∈ B, x = max a b}
```

The set of pairwise minima of elements from `A` and `B`.

Logical form:

```lean
def PairwiseMin (A B : Set ℝ) : Set ℝ :=
  {x | ∃ a ∈ A, ∃ b ∈ B, x = min a b}
```

